{"id":2,"titleZh":"什么是美国音乐？","titleEn":"What Is American Music?","date":"1958-02-01","dateZh":"1958 年 2 月 1 日","concepts":"民族音乐、切分音、爵士语调","thesis":"美国音乐不是喊口号或硬套印第安曲调，而是把爵士切分音变成像母语口音一样自然的习惯。","plain":"欧洲国家传统单一，美国却是由各国移民融合而成的新国家。早期美国作曲家经历过模仿欧洲、生硬拼贴民歌与刻意炫耀爵士的阶段，直到 1930 年代才真正成熟——作曲家不再把爵士当成装饰，而是让它成为写交响曲时的自然语调。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦在钢琴上唱《新世界交响曲》的《念故乡》，故意改填词唱“捷克斯洛伐克，我多思念你”，说明它本质是捷克风味而非美国黑人灵歌。","全场切分音拍手实验：先让观众按固定重拍鼓掌，打击乐手专门往拍子缝隙里加查尔斯顿重音把大家带偏；随后乐队改打死板重拍，反过来让全场孩子拍出摇摆的切分音，最后由科普兰亲自登场指挥《第三交响曲》终曲。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1Ht411E7rB","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ht411E7rB","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 什么是美国音乐？","duration":"58:55","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/what-is-american-music","repertoire":[{"composer":"Gershwin","piece":"An American in Paris","titleZh":"一个美国人在巴黎","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/7f/a3/bd/7fa3bd53-5e74-593a-1362-6e54b355c63f/mzaf_10903899735952442013.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/an-american-in-paris/594512997?i=594513241&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"An American in Paris","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Gershwin%20An%20American%20in%20Paris+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Gershwin%20An%20American%20in%20Paris"},{"composer":"George W. Chadwick","piece":"Melpomene Overture","titleZh":"墨尔波墨涅序曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/Music5/v4/e9/df/fb/e9dffb6f-8c97-da09-1f0e-35082958553b/mzaf_2683397970370450350.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/melpomene-overture/157579108?i=157579151&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Czech State Philharmonic & José Serebrier","recordingTrack":"Melpomene Overture","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=George%20W.%20Chadwick%20Melpomene